    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Stewart Estate Agents are delighted to present this superb site, ideally positioned in the highly sought-after Two Mile House area, just outside Naas, \r\nCo. Kildare.\r\n\r\nThe site is located within Zone 1 – Areas Under Strong Urban Influence, reflecting its proximity to Naas and the continued demand for residential development in this established and desirable location.\r\n\r\nThis well-located parcel of land offers clear potential for residential development, subject to the necessary planning permission and zoning requirements. Situated in a mature and highly regarded area, the site benefits from strong demand for housing and represents an excellent opportunity for those seeking to build in a prime location.\r\n\r\nThe Site is well positioned within easy reach of Naas, with Dublin accessible via the nearby M7 motorway, combining peaceful countryside surroundings with excellent connectivity.\r\n\r\nThis represents an excellent opportunity for purchasers seeking a site in one of South Kildare’s most desirable residential locations, with strong long-term appeal."
      }
    ],
